## Section reproduction (all 16 web SectionErrorBoundary regions — never blank)

header, battery-range, live-state, quick-stats, motor, climate, security, tire-pressure,
charging-telemetry, battery-charts, recent-drives, recent-charges, vehicle-config, ai-paint-preview,
quick-links, settings.
  Each region is a real SharedSurfaces.SectionErrorBoundary(FallbackTitle=<localized>) wrapping a stack
  (SectionTitle + a TsKVList of real data OR a localized TsEmptyState caption). header renders the
  resolved effective vehicle name; settings renders the resolved per-vehicle EffectiveSetting rows
  (key → value (source)); the other 14 render their localized "no data" caption (their per-section data
  sources are separate parity units, out of this unit's manifest scope) — never a blank region. Verified
  by Tests Success_builds_all_sixteen_section_regions_in_order, Every_section_carries_its_localized_fallback_title,
  Sections_without_in_scope_data_carry_a_localized_empty_message, Settings_section_renders_the_resolved_effective_settings,
  Effective_name_uses_the_nickname_override_when_present / _falls_back_to_the_title_without_a_nickname /
  _ignores_a_blank_or_non_text_nickname.

